@ 6.2.2 - Proto-Erythrean to Proto-North Erythrean
# citation: Mecislau, from Ehret, Christopher (1995), Reconstructing Proto-Afroasiatic
# 			(Proto-Afrasian): Vowels, Tone, Consonants, and Vocabulary (Voices from Asia)
	V{j,w} > V:[+ long] / C_C
	e:[+ long] o:[+ long] > i u
	{e,o} {i,u} > a ə
	$VC$ > $CV$ “(This last rule turned all VC roots into CV)”
	in > ŋ / #_C